  "uuid": "ea6225b7-6696-4260-8064-206f45dd3ec5",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "fe12eb05-14ca-8cab-e989-cf398b812a42",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "32023336-358e-7031-2799-2b8396444a6d",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "This year, 2025, the programme hosted 25 vibrant Saturday sessions, attended by 70 pupils (36 girls and 34 boys), each participating at least once. The children dive into diverse and engaging activities designed to nurture their minds and bodies.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Teacher Siben Takeh leads the English sessions, helping children learn to read, speak, and write, assisted by Eda Dyausa, Freddy Kivuyo, and Principal Azmina Jivan. The morning also features captivating Story Telling, lively Singing and Music, and creative Arts and Crafts with Mwalimu Farida, where colourful masterpieces are born. For active fun, coaches Patrick Ramadhan and Godson Rumisha oversee exciting Football sessions.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The learning and playing is always capped off with delicious Snacks, including warm porridge, tea, and cookies, with a special extended meal once a month. This weekly gathering truly is a place where children come to learn, play, and make lasting friendships.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
