    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For over seven years, the big green gate of the playschool at AKU Arusha under the Community Outreach Centre has opened every Saturday morning, welcoming the happiest little explorers from the neighbourhood. From 9 am to 11 am, children under thirteen rush in for a morning packed with laughter, learning, and fun, a tradition that has positively impacted the community for years.",
